#: ../../../how-to/shell-completions.rst:21
msgid ""
"A package can ship the completion script for its own command, the way it "
"ships a man page. pipx links that script out of the environment it installed "
"into, so the completions arrive with the package and leave with it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/shell-completions.rst:24
msgid ""
"pipx picks up the three directories a wheel installs completion scripts into "
"and links each under ``PIPX_COMPLETION_DIR`` (default ``~/.local/share``):"
msgstr ""

